  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "belebele-fleurs",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tBelebele-Fleurs\n\t\n\nBelebele-Fleurs is a dataset suitable to evaluate two core tasks:\n\nMultilingual Spoken Language Understanding (Listening Comprehension): For each spoken paragraph, the task is to answer a multiple-choice question. The question and four answer choices are provided in text form.\nMultilingual Long-Form Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR) with Diverse Speakers: By concatenating sentence-level utterances, long-form audio clips (ranging from 30 seconds to 1 minute 30\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/WueNLP/belebele-fleurs.",
